    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Move Reviews Tab Before Description for WooCommerce is the ultimate solution for enhancing your product page layout.</p>\n<p>By default, WooCommerce places the Reviews tab after the Description tab, making it harder for customers to see social proof when browsing your products.</p>\n<p>This simple but powerful plugin helps you move the Reviews tab to a more prominent position, right before the Description tab.</p>\n<p>See more via <a href=\"https://shieldclimb.com/free-woocommerce-plugins/reviews-tab-before-description/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">this website</a>.</p>\n<p>📺 <strong>Watch the full install and setup tutorial here:</strong><br />\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MIYzWyHn7D4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Download our plugin from https://shieldclimb.com/free-woocommerce-plugins/reviews-tab-before-description/</li>\n<li>At your WordPress admin, Go to Plugins &gt; Add New Plugin &gt; Upload Plugin &gt; Choose File (Choose the file you downloaded just now) &gt; Click Install</li>\n<li>Click Activate</li>\n</ol>\n<p>📺 <strong>Watch the full install and setup tutorial here:</strong><br />\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MIYzWyHn7D4?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>V1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Improved</strong>: Updated plugin tags for better discoverability, added installation &amp; usage video to plugin page.</li>\n<li><strong>Updated</strong>: Tested up to WooCommerce 10.0.3</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>V1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Updated</strong>: Tested up to WordPress 6.8 and WooCommerce 9.8.1</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>V1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
